      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Before electricity, there is bronze. The Steam chapter builds everything with a crafting table, a hammer and a file: a single-shot Hand Cannon, stone ammunition, and three sets of light armor. No machine is required, although one steam-powered Ammo Press makes bullets for you.\n\nThe gate material here is bronze (cast iron for the Miner set). Hold eight bronze plates to open the chapter; the Hand Cannon eats a plate, and the Steam armor takes fourteen.\n\nThe plan is simple. Build the cannon and some bullets, test them on zombies, then dress for the job: Heavy Cloth is the base of every armor set, and bronze plates armor the parts that matter. When you have all of that and a few steel plates, the LV chapter is next.\n\n[note]This chapter pays the first loot bags and Pam\u0027s snacks. Eat up, then go shoot something.[/note]",
